WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Look! A little beetle is beside a green leaf.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.200
It climbs slowly with its six tiny legs.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.200
The green leaf is a cozy place for the beetle to rest.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.300
We can watch gently without touching. Bye, little beetle!
